[{"id":"fm-core1-1.21-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Sketch each of the following curves:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y^2=12x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y^2=2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y^2=-6x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.21/solutions/assets/diagrams/121-p1-1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.21/solutions/assets/diagrams/121-p1-2.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.21/solutions/assets/diagrams/121-p1-3.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.21-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Each of the following curves are of the form</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y^2=ax\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a constant. In each case state the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.21/questions/assets/diagrams/121-q2a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.21/questions/assets/diagrams/121-q2b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.21/questions/assets/diagrams/121-q2c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\sqrt{12})^2=3a\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore a=4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-\\sqrt2)^2=-a\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore a=-2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"6^2=6\\sqrt6x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore a=\\sqrt6\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.21-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>A curve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C_1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is given by the equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=kx^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is constant. A second curve, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, is shown on the diagram which is the image of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C_1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> under a reflection over the line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.21/questions/assets/diagrams/121-q3.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=\\frac14\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find an equation for curve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and the coordinates of the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find an equation for curve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and the coordinates of the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find an equation for curve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and the coordinates of the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>intersection of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac14y^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\ny=\\frac14y^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow y(1-\\tfrac14y)=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\therefore y=0\\text{ or }y=4\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y^2=4x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P(4,4)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>intersection of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=3y^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\ny=3y^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow y(1-3y)=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\therefore y=0\\text{ or }y=\\frac13\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y^2=4x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P(4,4)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y^2=\\frac13x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P(\\frac13,\\frac13)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>intersection of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=ay^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\ny=ay^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow y(1-ay)=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\therefore y=0\\text{ or }y=\\frac1a\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y^2=4x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P(4,4)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y^2=\\frac1ax\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P(\\frac1a,\\frac1a)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.21-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>State the coordinates of the vertex for each of the parabolas below:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y-4=(x-2)^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x-4=(y-2)^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y+1=(x-5)^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x+1=(y+5)^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2,4)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4,2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(5,-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-1,-5)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.21-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>A parabola is given by the equation</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(y-a)^2=x-b\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are constants is shown in the diagram below. The points of intersection with the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis are <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and with the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"R\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.21/questions/assets/diagrams/121-q5.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>State the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Find the coordinates of points <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"R\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(y-3)^2=x+4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=3\\pm2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P(0,5)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q(0,1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"R(5,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]}]